       hand-authored: touch.s's own header: a missing operand is CREATEd empty, TXT type -- proved by a follow-up CAT (empty output) in the same session; see cp -r's own reason for why this is hand- not host-authored.
  PASS -t explicit timestamp -- Use the specified time instead of the current time.
